{
    "ID":"6MC7",
    "dest":["5DA", "5DD"],
    "type":"text",
    "repeat":2,
    "title":"Flächeninhalte zweier Figuren vergleichen",
    "description":"Flächeninhalte ohne Rechnung vergleichen, Kästchen zählen, Zerlegen und Ergänzen, Umlegen, Figuren. Nicht für die interaktive Nutzung (online/Duell) geeignet.",
    "question":"Welche Figur hat den größeren Flächeninhalt: Figur 1 oder Figur 2? Oder sind beide gleich groß? Entscheide ohne zu rechnen.",
    "options":[
        {
            "name":"Gleiche Form, eine Kerbe am Rand",
            "vars":{
                "a":"3_5",
                "b":"3_5",
                "nw":"1_${:a-2}",
                "nh":"1_${:b-1}",
                "nx1":"1_${:a-1-:nw}",
                "nx2":"${:nx1+:nw}",
                "gap":2,
                "ox2":"${:a+:gap}",
                "notchFig":"1_2",
                "otherFig":"${:notchFig==1?2:1}",
                "nhL":"${:notchFig==1?:nh:0}",
                "nhR":"${:notchFig==2?:nh:0}",
                "areaFull":"${:a*:b}",
                "areaNotch":"${:a*:b-:nw*:nh}"
            },
            "figure":{
                "type":"graph",
                "axis":false,
                "grid":true,
                "boundingbox":[-1,"${:b+2}","${2*:a+:gap+1}",-1.5],
                "content":[
                    ["point",[0,0],{"name":"L1","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:a}",0],{"name":"L2","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:a}","${:b}"],{"name":"L3","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:nx2}","${:b}"],{"name":"L4","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:nx2}","${:b-:nhL}"],{"name":"L5","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:nx1}","${:b-:nhL}"],{"name":"L6","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:nx1}","${:b}"],{"name":"L7","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[0,"${:b}"],{"name":"L8","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["polygon",["L1","L2","L3","L4","L5","L6","L7","L8"],{"fillColor":"none","strokeWidth":2}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2}",0],{"name":"R1","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+:a}",0],{"name":"R2","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+:a}","${:b}"],{"name":"R3","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+:nx2}","${:b}"],{"name":"R4","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+:nx2}","${:b-:nhR}"],{"name":"R5","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+:nx1}","${:b-:nhR}"],{"name":"R6","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+:nx1}","${:b}"],{"name":"R7","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2}","${:b}"],{"name":"R8","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["polygon",["R1","R2","R3","R4","R5","R6","R7","R8"],{"fillColor":"none","strokeWidth":2}],
                    ["text",["${:a/2}","${:b+1}","Figur 1"],{"anchorX":"middle","fontSize":14}],
                    ["text",["${:ox2+:a/2}","${:b+1}","Figur 2"],{"anchorX":"middle","fontSize":14}]
                ]
            },
            "answer":"Figur ${:otherFig} ist größer: Sie besteht aus ${:areaFull} Kästchen, Figur ${:notchFig} mit der Kerbe am Rand nur aus ${:areaNotch}.",
            "value":"Figur ${:otherFig}"
        },
        {
            "name":"Verschiedene Formen, Zerlegen und Umlegen",
            "vars":{
                "hts":"1_6_4_^&",
                "h0":"${:hts[0]}",
                "h1":"${:hts[1]}",
                "h2":"${:hts[2]}",
                "h3":"${:hts[3]}",
                "gap":2,
                "ox2":"${4+:gap}",
                "maxH":"${Math.max(:h0,:h1,:h2,:h3)}",
                "areaTot":"${:h0+:h1+:h2+:h3}"
            },
            "figure":{
                "type":"graph",
                "axis":false,
                "grid":true,
                "boundingbox":[-1,"${:maxH+2}","${:ox2+5}",-1.5],
                "content":[
                    ["point",[0,0],{"name":"A0","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[0,"${:h0}"],{"name":"A1","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[1,"${:h0}"],{"name":"A2","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[1,"${:h1}"],{"name":"A3","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[2,"${:h1}"],{"name":"A4","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[2,"${:h2}"],{"name":"A5","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[3,"${:h2}"],{"name":"A6","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[3,"${:h3}"],{"name":"A7","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[4,"${:h3}"],{"name":"A8","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",[4,0],{"name":"A9","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["polygon",["A0","A1","A2","A3","A4","A5","A6","A7","A8","A9"],{"fillColor":"none","strokeWidth":2}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2}",0],{"name":"B0","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2}","${:h1}"],{"name":"B1","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+1}","${:h1}"],{"name":"B2","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+1}","${:h2}"],{"name":"B3","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+2}","${:h2}"],{"name":"B4","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+2}","${:h3}"],{"name":"B5","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+3}","${:h3}"],{"name":"B6","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+3}","${:h0}"],{"name":"B7","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+4}","${:h0}"],{"name":"B8","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["point",["${:ox2+4}",0],{"name":"B9","face":"","label":{"visible":false}}],
                    ["polygon",["B0","B1","B2","B3","B4","B5","B6","B7","B8","B9"],{"fillColor":"none","strokeWidth":2}],
                    ["text",[2,"${:maxH+1}","Figur 1"],{"anchorX":"middle","fontSize":14}],
                    ["text",["${:ox2+2}","${:maxH+1}","Figur 2"],{"anchorX":"middle","fontSize":14}]
                ]
            },
            "answer":"Beide Figuren sind gleich groß (je ${:areaTot} Kästchen): Schneidet man bei Figur 1 die erste Spalte ab und setzt sie am Ende der Reihe wieder an, erhält man Figur 2.",
            "value":"gleich groß"
        }
    ]
}
